@startuml
actor Customer
participant "Frontend (React)" as FE
participant "API BookingController" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

Customer -> FE: Click ghế (Available)
FE -> FE: Sinh SessionId
FE -> API: POST /hold (SessionId, SeatId)
API -> DB: Query GheChuyenBay
DB --> API: Entity Seat (PhienBan=1)
API -> API: Check Available == true
API -> API: Set Held, GiuDenLuc = +30m, PhienBan=2
API -> DB: SaveChangesAsync()
note right of DB: Optimistic Concurrency check:\nWHERE Id=SeatId AND PhienBan=1
DB --> API: Success (1 row affected)
API --> FE: 200 OK
FE -> Customer: Hiển thị ghế màu Vàng
@enduml
